  "title": "Karneval (2013)",
  "justification": "AniDB specials S1-S11 \"Comics Cover Ura Comments 01-11\" are by character (Yogi, Hirato, Nai, Akari, Tsukumo, Jiki, Tsukitachi, Kiichi, Iva, Hitsuji, Gareki); TheTVDB season 0 episodes 4-14 carry the same comments by character: コミックスカバー裏コメント＜平門＞ (4), ＜與儀＞ (5), ＜燭＞ (6), ＜无＞ (7), ＜喰＞ (8), ＜ツクモ＞ (9), ＜朔＞ (10), ＜キイチ＞ (11), ＜イヴァ＞ (12), ＜羊＞ (13), ＜花礫＞ (14). S12 \"Karneval Fashion with J. Michael Tatum\" is episode 2 \"Karneval Fasion\". By default S1 fell on episode 1, the 2012 OVA, and each later special on another character's comment. On TMDB 65675 season 0, whose only episode is the 2012 \"OVA\" (AniDB 9334), special S1 \"Comics Cover Ura Comments 01: Yogi\" fell by default on that episode. TMDB lists no comment special, so S1 is unmapped there.",
